Subject: [PATCH 0060] drm-kmod: checkpoints in the display driver's probe (applied to drm-kmod, after 0052)

nmx_trace("<function>: <call>") before each statement-level call in intel_display_driver_probe_noirq,
intel_display_driver_probe_nogem, intel_display_driver_probe and intel_modeset_setup_hw_state (readout and sanitize of
what the firmware left on). nmx_trace is NMXGPU's (bsdcompat/src/nmx_trace.c, 0055/0058): off unless the boot
argument nmxtrace is set; nmxtrace=3 also keeps the last step in NVRAM (nullmoth-gpu-trace).

